# ============================================================
# Sumber jadwal utama: spreadsheet "monthly calendar" via Google Sheets API.
# Butuh warna cell (workshop/event badge), yang cuma bisa lewat API v4 — bukan CSV.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Google Cloud Console -> buat/pilih project -> enable "Google Sheets API"
# 2. Credentials -> Create API key -> GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_KEY
# 3. ID di URL Sheet: docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/<INI>/edit -> SCHEDULE_SHEET_ID
# 4. Sheet di-share "Anyone with the link" (Viewer)
#
# Aplikasi otomatis ambil minggu Senin–Minggu mendatang. Tiap bulan = 1 tab
# (mis. "(2026) JUL"), minggu ditumpuk vertikal, tiap hari 3 kolom shala +
# kolom TIME SLOT. Legend "COLOR MEANING" menentukan warna workshop/rental.
# ============================================================
GOOGLE_SHEETS_API_KEY=
SCHEDULE_SHEET_ID=

# Admin-only access for /stories. Use a strong unique password and a long random secret.
# Example secret command: openssl rand -base64 32
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=

# Momence supplies the live classes used in Daily Social Downloads.
# The Path's host ID is 14607; leave this value unless the Momence account changes.
MOMENCE_HOST_ID=14607

# Opsional: kalau API key/sheet ID kosong, aplikasi jatuh ke snapshot lokal
# di lib/fallback.ts (source: "fallback").

# Opsional: tab berisi kolom Name,Photo untuk foto teacher (publish-to-web CSV)
TEACHERS_CSV_URL=
